@startuml
title exact-orb — N9: Session TTL истёк во время расчёта

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B
    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

box "CLIENT / API" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch
    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
    control "ProfileService" as Profile
end box

box "SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "Session Store" as Store
end box

box "CALCULATION" #FFF7CC
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as Artifact
    database "Calculation Cache" as Cache
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as Engine
end box

User -> FE : Отправляет данные рождения
FE -> API : POST /charts/natal\nexisting session cookie
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand

Orch -> Context : start_build(session_id)
Context -> Store : save BuildAttempt(PROCESSING)
Store --> Context : saved with TTL
Context --> Orch : build registered

Orch ->> Handler : execute(run A)
Handler ->> Artifact : ensure_natal(...)
Artifact ->> Engine : long calculation

== TTL сессии истекает ==

Store -> Store : session TTL expired\ndelete SessionContext

Engine --> Artifact : valid ChartArtifact
Artifact -> Cache : put(calculation_key, ChartArtifact)
Artifact --> Handler : ChartArtifact
Handler -> Profile : prepare_base_delta(...)
Profile --> Handler : SessionProfileDelta
Handler --> Orch : BuildCompleted(A, delta)

Orch -> Context : commit_build_success(session_id, A, delta)
Context -> Store : atomic CAS
Store --> Context : SESSION_NOT_FOUND / EXPIRED
Context --> Orch : SESSION_EXPIRED

Orch --> API : 410 SESSION_EXPIRED
API --> FE : typed expired-session response
FE -> FE : discard stale client session state
FE --> User : Показывает новую форму\nи сообщает об истечении сессии

note over Context, Store
Для результата старого run новая session
автоматически не создаётся.
SessionProfileDelta не сохраняется.
end note

note over Artifact, Cache
ChartArtifact может остаться в общем cache,
но больше не связан с пользовательским состоянием.
end note

@enduml
